          "changelog": "The focus timer now has the now-playing widget along the bottom: tap it for the full-screen player, which shows the focus timer beside Back, or press the dial to play/pause without leaving the timer. Tap the clock in Home's dock to show the screensaver right away. The screensaver only shows the current track while it's playing."
